  "description": "Carol, Eri, and Pam form Midnight Serenade, a pop punk band that just wants to make their way, play beyond their small venue, and prove their music can take them far.\n\nBut right before their first concert, an infernal creature appears to warn them that their music could unleash the end of the world.\nWhat starts as an impossible warning soon turns into a struggle between forces beyond all logic.\nAnd as the line between what's real and what shouldn't exist begins to break... the girls will have to decide how far they're willing to go to hold on to what they love.\n\n_Source: Planeta Cómic, translated_",
